{"event":"changes_requested","job_id":"docs-payment-methods-trustly-android-drop-in-earlier-versions","reason":"The pinned raw hash matches, and the candidate accurately captures the v4.x.x Advanced redirect/details flow, Sessions-link tension, examples, statuses and webhook events. Its qualification of the guide's 'funds in 3 days' statement stops at lack of proof for an individual transaction. The related Trustly overview materially contradicts an unconditional funding expectation: even after successful AUTHORISATION, funds may never arrive because the transfer can fail; Adyen reports SentForSettle until receipt and may issue a chargeback after eight calendar days. A reader asking whether an Authorised result or successful webhook guarantees receipt would miss that warning."}
